{"seq":3,"slug":"vectorization-eligibility-dependency-bandwidth","title":"向量化的前提条件：数据依赖、内存别名与带宽/频率边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/cpu-simd-vectorization-avx-neon-intrinsics-engineering/simd-hardware-vector-model/vectorization-eligibility-dependency-bandwidth","wordCount":2432,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"向量化的前提条件-数据依赖-内存别名与带宽-频率边界\">向量化的前提条件：数据依赖、内存别名与带宽/频率边界</h1><p>一段标量 <code>for</code> 循环能不能变成一条 512 位加法，不取决于你写不写 <code>_mm512_add_ps</code>，而取决于三件事同时成立：<strong>合法</strong>（语义上允许把多次迭代打包）、<strong>有利</strong>（打包后真的更快，而不是被内存或频率吃掉）、<strong>可表达</strong>（编译器能找到证据，或你手工给出证据）。这三道门任何一道不过，向量化就会静默失败——代码照常运行，只是慢。本文把这三次判定拆开讲清楚。硬件层面对应的执行模型见同章节 <a href=\"simd-datapath-lane-execution-model\">SIMD 数据通路与通道执行模型</a>，ISA 家族的宽度与能力差异见 <a href=\"isa-portfolio-avx2-avx512-neon-sve\">ISA 家族谱系</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>把向量化当成一次<strong>循环变换的合法性证明</strong>：把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 次迭代重排成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N/V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 组、每组 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 个元素的并行计算，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 是向量长度（AVX2 的 256 位对应 8 个 <code>float</code>，AVX-512 的 512 位对应 16 个，ARM SVE 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 在 128–2048 位间可伸缩）。重排只有在不改变可观察结果时才被允许，这就是依赖与别名要解决的问题；重排只有在收益为正时才值得做，这就是带宽与频率边界要解决的问题。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[标量循环] --&gt; B{合法? 依赖与别名}&#10;    B --&gt;|存在不可分解的&lt;br/&gt;循环携带依赖| C[拒绝向量化&lt;br/&gt;或需算法改写]&#10;    B --&gt;|无阻碍依赖&lt;br/&gt;且别名可证不重叠| D{有利? 成本模型}&#10;    D --&gt;|算术强度低&lt;br/&gt;带宽受限| E[向量化但无加速&lt;br/&gt;需分块/流存储]&#10;    D --&gt;|算术强度高| F{可表达? 证据}&#10;    F --&gt;|编译器自动|&lt; G[autovectorize]&#10;    F --&gt;|需手工提示|&lt; H[restrict / omp simd / intrinsics]&#10;    G --&gt; I[向量化循环]&#10;    H --&gt; I\">graph TD\n    A[标量循环] --&gt; B{合法? 依赖与别名}\n    B --&gt;|存在不可分解的&lt;br/&gt;循环携带依赖| C[拒绝向量化&lt;br/&gt;或需算法改写]\n    B --&gt;|无阻碍依赖&lt;br/&gt;且别名可证不重叠| D{有利? 成本模型}\n    D --&gt;|算术强度低&lt;br/&gt;带宽受限| E[向量化但无加速&lt;br/&gt;需分块/流存储]\n    D --&gt;|算术强度高| F{可表达? 证据}\n    F --&gt;|编译器自动|&lt; G[autovectorize]\n    F --&gt;|需手工提示|&lt; H[restrict / omp simd / intrinsics]\n    G --&gt; I[向量化循环]\n    H --&gt; I</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>前提</th>\n<th>违反时的典型症状</th>\n<th>编译器检测手段</th>\n<th>处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>合法：依赖</td>\n<td><code>-fopt-info-vec-missed</code> 报 <code>not vectorized: complicated access pattern</code></td>\n<td>依赖距离分析（GCC <code>tree-data-ref</code>、LLVM <code>LoopAccessAnalysis</code>）</td>\n<td>改写算法、拆分循环、归约化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合法：别名</td>\n<td>报 <code>possible dependence between data-refs</code></td>\n<td><code>restrict</code> 限定、别名分析</td>\n<td>加 <code>restrict</code>、<code>#pragma omp simd</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有利：成本</td>\n<td>报 <code>vectorized</code> 但实测无变化</td>\n<td><code>-fvect-cost-model</code>、LLVM cost model</td>\n<td>分块、非临时存储、改用标量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可表达：证据</td>\n<td>报 <code>unknown trip count</code> 或 <code>control flow</code></td>\n<td>运行时检查（versioning）</td>\n<td>固定迭代上界、消除分支</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三道门中，<strong>合法性是二值的</strong>（要么能证明，要么不能），<strong>有利性是有量的</strong>（加速比可能是 0.9 也可能是 8）。工程上最常见的错误是把顺序搞反——先追逐 AVX-512 宽度，再回头发现循环内存带宽受限，宽度翻倍换不来任何收益。</p>\n<h2 id=\"循环携带依赖与归约\">循环携带依赖与归约</h2><p><strong>循环携带依赖</strong>（loop-carried dependence）是指第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 次迭代访问了第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i-\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7429em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 次迭代写入的位置，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 称为依赖距离。判定的关键不是「有没有依赖」，而是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 的大小与依赖是否可结合：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta \\ge V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>（向量宽度）时仍可向量化，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta &lt; V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 且不可分解时才会被拒绝。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// 不可向量化：a[i] 依赖 a[i-1]，距离 delta = 1&#10;for (int i = 1; i &lt; n; i++)&#10;    a[i] = a[i - 1] * c + b[i];&#10;&#10;// 可向量化：每次迭代只读 b、c 与写 a，无跨迭代依赖&#10;for (int i = 0; i &lt; n; i++)&#10;    a[i] = b[i] * c[i] + d;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 不可向量化：a[i] 依赖 a[i-1]，距离 delta = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 可向量化：每次迭代只读 b、c 与写 a，无跨迭代依赖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>归约</strong>（reduction）是一个反直觉但关键的例外：<code>sum += a[i]</code> 在标量语义下严格串行，但因为加法的可结合性，编译器可以把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 项分成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 条独立的部分和，最后横向相加。判定标准不是「有没有跨迭代依赖」，而是<strong>该依赖是否为一个可结合的归约算子</strong>（<code>+</code>、<code>*</code>、<code>min</code>、<code>max</code>、按位运算）。GCC 会输出 <code>reduction:</code> 提示，LLVM 在 <code>-Rpass=loop-vectorize</code> 里报告 <code>vectorized reduction</code>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>依赖距离</th>\n<th>可向量化</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>逐元素映射 <code>a[i]=f(b[i])</code></td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>完全独立</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>归约 <code>s+=a[i]</code></td>\n<td>有（跨全部）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>算子可结合，允许重组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前缀和 / 扫描</td>\n<td>有（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>否（原生）</td>\n<td>强串行；需 log-step 或 SIMD 扫描算法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>递推 <code>a[i]=a[i-1]*c</code></td>\n<td>有（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>状态串行传播</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>历史依赖 <code>a[i]+=a[i-k]</code></td>\n<td>有（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta=k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k \\ge V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 时是</td>\n<td>距离大于向量宽度即可并存</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行值得记住：<strong>依赖距离大于向量宽度时，向量化仍然合法</strong>。长度为 8 的向量一次覆盖 8 次迭代，只要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta \\ge 8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span>，两次冲突的迭代不会落在同一批里。这正是 LLVM <code>MemoryDepChecker</code> 计算 <code>MaxSafeDepDistBytes</code> 并把结果交给向量化器决策的地方（参见 LLVM 官方文档 <a href=\"https://llvm.org/docs/Vectorizers.html\">https://llvm.org/docs/Vectorizers.html</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内存别名-编译器为什么保守\">内存别名：编译器为什么保守</h2><p>即便依赖距离为零，编译器仍可能拒绝向量化——因为它无法排除两个指针指向同一块内存。C 语言默认允许任意指针别名，<code>void f(float *a, float *b)</code> 里的 <code>a</code> 与 <code>b</code> 有可能重叠，于是「先读 <code>b</code> 再写 <code>a</code>」的重排不再安全。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// 编译器无法证明 a 与 b 不重叠，可能保留标量顺序&#10;void scale(float *a, const float *b, int n) {&#10;    for (int i = 0; i &lt; n; i++) a[i] = b[i] * 2.0f;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 用 C99 restrict 承诺不重叠，解锁向量化&#10;void scale_restrict(float * restrict a, const float * restrict b, int n) {&#10;    for (int i = 0; i &lt; n; i++) a[i] = b[i] * 2.0f;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 编译器无法证明 a 与 b 不重叠，可能保留标量顺序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> scale</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> float</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 用 C99 restrict 承诺不重叠，解锁向量化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> scale_restrict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> restrict</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> float</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> restrict</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>restrict</code>（C99，MSVC 写作 <code>__restrict</code>）是把别名信息<strong>从程序员转移到编译器</strong>的契约：你承诺在该指针生命周期内，通过它访问的对象不会被其他指针访问。若承诺为假，行为未定义——这是向量化里最容易被误用的一条。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>作用范围</th>\n<th>迁移性</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>restrict</code> / <code>__restrict</code></td>\n<td>单个指针参数</td>\n<td>C99 标准、C++ 靠扩展</td>\n<td>承诺为假即 UB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>#pragma omp simd</code></td>\n<td>单个循环</td>\n<td>OpenMP 4.5+，GCC/Clang/ICC 支持</td>\n<td>断言无依赖，错了结果错</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>#pragma clang loop vectorize(assume_safety)</code></td>\n<td>单个循环</td>\n<td>Clang 专有</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手工 intrinsics</td>\n<td>整段代码</td>\n<td>全平台可写，但不可移植</td>\n<td>需自行保证语义等价</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在 C++ 里没有 <code>restrict</code> 关键字，通常用 GCC/Clang 的 <code>__restrict__</code> 或 <code>std::assume_aligned</code>。真正危险的场景是两个参数可能指向同一数组的不同偏移——这时 <code>restrict</code> 会给出错误答案，正确做法是显式处理原地情形。</p>\n<h2 id=\"带宽与频率边界-内存墙-roofline-与降频\">带宽与频率边界：内存墙、Roofline 与降频</h2><p>合法之后是有利。Roofline 模型（Williams、Waterman、Patterson，<em>Communications of the ACM</em>, 2009）把性能上界写成算术强度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span>（每字节内存流量对应的浮点运算数）与峰值带宽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BW</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 的乘积：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>peak</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>I</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>W</mi><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P = \\min\\bigl(P_{\\text{peak}},\\; I \\times BW\\bigr)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">peak</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>W</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>peak</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I \\times BW &lt; P_{\\text{peak}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">peak</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时，循环是<strong>内存带宽受限</strong>的：把向量宽度从 256 位翻到 512 位，只会让每次加载搬来更多数据，吞吐被 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BW</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 死死卡住。分界点大致在每字节 10–20 FLOP 量级——GEMM、FFT 蝶形这类高算术强度循环 (<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I &gt; 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span>) 吃满计算单元，加宽向量与 FMA 直接带来收益；一维卷积、dot product (<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 &lt; I &lt; 10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span>) 处于过渡区，需配合分块；流式拷贝、逐元素 <code>a[i]=b[i]*k</code>、稀疏 gather (<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>) 早已撞上内存墙，加宽向量无效。</p>\n<p>带宽受限循环的三条出路：<strong>分块</strong>（tiling）把工作集压进 L1/L2，使重复访问命中缓存而非内存；<strong>非临时存储</strong>（<code>_mm512_stream_ps</code>，ARM 上的 <code>stnp</code>）绕过缓存写出，避免污染缓存；<strong>减少数据宽度</strong>（fp32 转 bf16/fp16 或整数量化）直接砍掉一半以上流量。切忌对带宽受限循环做无脑展开与向量化——那只会抬高寄存器压力而吞吐不变。</p>\n<p><strong>频率</strong>是第二个边界。AVX-512 在 Intel Skylake-X 一代引入了许可证（license）驱动的降频：重度 512 位指令（如 FMA）会触发更高的功耗预算等级，使核心频率下降，最高可差十余个百分点。该现象由 Travis Downs 在 2020 年系统测量并记录（<a href=\"https://travisdowns.github.io/blog/2020/01/17/avxfreq1.html\">https://travisdowns.github.io/blog/2020/01/17/avxfreq1.html</a>），它意味着<strong>512 位并非总是快于 256 位</strong>——只有当计算受限且收益大于频率损失时才划算。后续几代惩罚逐步减弱：Intel Ice Lake 服务器显著收窄了幅度，Sapphire Rapids 之后进一步放宽了频率管理；AMD 从 Zen 4 起用 256 位数据通路「双泵」（double-pumping）执行 512 位指令，避开激进降频，但每个 512 位操作占两个周期（参见 Chips and Cheese 的 Zen 4 分析 <a href=\"https://chipsandcheese.com/p/zen-4s-avx-512\">https://chipsandcheese.com/p/zen-4s-avx-512</a>）。ARM 的 SVE/SVE2 用可伸缩向量，宽度由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 决定、由硬件实现选择（参见 ARM 架构文档 <a href=\"https://developer.arm.com/Architectures/Scalable%20Vector%20Extensions\">https://developer.arm.com/Architectures/Scalable%20Vector%20Extensions</a>），从根本上回避了「写死 512 位」的可移植性问题。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>向量宽度</th>\n<th>数据通路</th>\n<th>频率影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Intel Skylake-X</td>\n<td>512 位</td>\n<td>原生 512 位</td>\n<td>重度 512 位指令触发 license 降频，明显</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Intel Ice Lake / Sapphire Rapids</td>\n<td>512 位</td>\n<td>原生 512 位</td>\n<td>降频幅度大幅收窄</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AMD Zen 4 / Zen 5</td>\n<td>512 位</td>\n<td>256 位双泵</td>\n<td>基本无激进降频，512 位操作占两个周期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ARM Neoverse (SVE/SVE2)</td>\n<td>128–2048 位可伸缩</td>\n<td>由实现决定</td>\n<td>无「宽向量惩罚」的架构性承诺</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>x86 AVX2</td>\n<td>256 位</td>\n<td>原生 256 位</td>\n<td>无专门降频</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个可操作的判据：<strong>先测带宽，再测频率，最后才谈宽度</strong>——用 <code>perf stat</code> 的 <code>cycles</code>、<code>llc_miss</code> 与内存带宽计数器判断循环属于哪一区。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用编译器证据判定前提是否成立\">用编译器证据判定前提是否成立</h2><p>前提是否满足，不能靠猜。GCC 与 Clang/LLVM 都能把向量化决策连同行号打印出来。GCC 从 4.9 起提供 <code>-fopt-info</code> 家族（见 GCC 官方手册 <a href=\"https://gcc.gnu.org/onlinedocs/gcc/Optimize-Options.html\">https://gcc.gnu.org/onlinedocs/gcc/Optimize-Options.html</a>）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# GCC：-missed 定位「为什么没向量化」&#10;gcc -O3 -march=native -fopt-info-vec-missed prog.c&#10;&#10;# LLVM：报告成功、失败与原因分析&#10;clang -O3 -march=native -Rpass=loop-vectorize -Rpass-missed=loop-vectorize \\&#10;      -Rpass-analysis=loop-vectorize prog.c\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># GCC：-missed 定位「为什么没向量化」</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gcc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -O3</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -march=native</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -fopt-info-vec-missed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> prog.c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># LLVM：报告成功、失败与原因分析</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">clang</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -O3</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -march=native</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -Rpass=loop-vectorize</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -Rpass-missed=loop-vectorize</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      -Rpass-analysis=loop-vectorize</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> prog.c</span></span></code></pre></div><p>把两类输出对照读，能直接把问题归到三道门上：出现 <code>possible dependence</code> / <code>unsafe dependent memory operations</code> 是别名门；出现 <code>not vectorized: complicated access pattern</code> / <code>unknown trip count</code> 是依赖或可表达门；出现 <code>vectorized</code> 但无加速，则是带宽/频率门——这时要测吞吐，而不是继续加宽向量。Intel 平台的 <code>-march=native</code> 在 2026 年的 GCC/Clang 中会对 AVX-512 目标给出 <code>-mprefer-vector-width=256</code> 偏好（256 位往往综合更优），若确实要强制 512 位需显式写 <code>-mprefer-vector-width=512</code> 并评估降频代价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>向量化要过三道门：<strong>合法</strong>（依赖与别名）、<strong>有利</strong>（带宽与频率）、<strong>可表达</strong>（编译器证据或手工提示）；顺序不能颠倒。</li>\n<li>依赖距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta \\ge V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 时仍可向量化；归约可向量化的判据是算子可结合，而非「没有依赖」。</li>\n<li>C 语言里只要不写 <code>restrict</code>，编译器就无权假设两个指针不重叠——这是「循环明明简单却没向量化」排在第一位的原因。</li>\n<li>Roofline 给出上界 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>peak</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=\\min(P_{\\text{peak}}, I\\times BW)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">peak</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 低的循环加宽向量没用，要靠分块、非临时存储或降位宽。</li>\n<li>AVX-512 的降频在 Skylake-X 上明显、在 Ice Lake 及之后显著收窄；AMD Zen 4/5 用 256 位双泵实现 512 位而不激进降频，ARM SVE 以可伸缩宽度回避了固定宽度问题。- 别用猜测代替证据：<code>-fopt-info-vec-missed</code> 与 <code>-Rpass-missed=loop-vectorize -Rpass-analysis=loop-vectorize</code> 会把失败原因连同行号说出来。</li>\n<li>先用 <code>perf stat</code> 判定循环属于带宽受限还是计算受限，再决定向量宽度，是避免「宽向量零收益」的最短路径。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"向量化的前提条件：数据依赖、内存别名与带宽/频率边界","id":"向量化的前提条件-数据依赖-内存别名与带宽-频率边界"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"循环携带依赖与归约","id":"循环携带依赖与归约"},{"level":2,"text":"内存别名：编译器为什么保守","id":"内存别名-编译器为什么保守"},{"level":2,"text":"带宽与频率边界：内存墙、Roofline 与降频","id":"带宽与频率边界-内存墙-roofline-与降频"},{"level":2,"text":"用编译器证据判定前提是否成立","id":"用编译器证据判定前提是否成立"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"指令集谱系对比：AVX2/AVX-512/NEON/SVE 的掩码、宽度与编码约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/cpu-simd-vectorization-avx-neon-intrinsics-engineering/simd-hardware-vector-model/isa-portfolio-avx2-avx512-neon-sve"},"next":{"title":"Intrinsics 类型系统与寄存器模型：从 __m256 到 arm_neon 向量类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/cpu-simd-vectorization-avx-neon-intrinsics-engineering/intrinsics-data-movement/intrinsics-type-register-model"}}